                                                "sense_id": "71935592-e481-31dd-95ae-6ee114fb99bf",
                                                "text": "Because all Asari present as female and use female pronouns, the deadly sexual nature of Ardat-Yakshi may reflect the continued fear of lesbianism that persists among many in human society."
                                            }
